# Project\_2\_File\_Transfer\_Protocol\_FTP\_Server\_Software\_Application

CSCI 460 - Networks and Communications*, Spring, '25*

## *Overview*

*"This FTP server application implements a File Transfer Protocol (FTP) server that listens for client connections and handles FTP commands over control and data sockets. It supports standard FTP operations including user authentication, directory navigation, passive mode data transfers, file listing, and file retrieval on the server side."&#32;*[1]

